{"id":3,"role":"Assistant","content":"","timestamp":1785988626,"token_count":0,"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"task_items\":[{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03): PROVED transfer_matrix_fubini_integrability. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2972 jobs).\",\"id\":\"60\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03): PROVED transfer_matrix_integrand_ae. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN.\",\"id\":\"61\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03): PROVED transfer_matrix_fubini_character_expansion_self (step-4c). Build GREEN.\",\"id\":\"47\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03 session 10): PROVED transfer_matrix_fubini_inner_pull (Lemma 4b) + defined fourierCoeffPos/fourierCoeffNeg. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"62\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03 session 11): PROVED transfer_matrix_fubini_integrated_pull (Step 4e). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"63\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03 session 12): PROVED plaquetteLinkIdx_reflect. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2890 jobs).\",\"id\":\"66\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-03 session 13): PROVED Lemma 3 INFRASTRUCTURE (reflectInterfaceLink + involution, mem lemmas, reflectInterfaceLinkPosNegEquiv, reflectInterfaceLinkPosToNeg_apply). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"67\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 14): PROVED thetaReindex + 4 case lemmas + CORE per-link character identity charFactorNeg_thetaReindex_link_eq. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"68\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 15): PROVED Lemma 3 MAIN POINTWISE IDENTITY charFactorNeg_thetaReindex_eq_charFactorPos + star version. Uses Finset.prod_bij reindexing via reflectInterfaceLink. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"64\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 15): PROVED Lemma 3 sub-step 4 — Fourier coeff identity fourierCoeffNeg_thetaReindex_eq_star_fourierCoeffPos. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs).\",\"id\":\"69\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 16): PROVED thetaReindex_idempotent (θ²=θ, NOT involution) + charFactorPos/Int/fourierCoeffPos θ-invariance lemmas. KEY FINDING: θ is a PROJECTION (not bijection); sum reindexing w↦θw is INVALID. Correct reindexing is w* (swaps pos↔neg via φ, bijection iff dual is bijection). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs). See §8.11.24.\",\"id\":\"70\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 17): PROVED fullReflectReindex (w*) + per-link identity + product identity + star version + PLAIN FORM IDENTITY fourierCoeffNeg_eq_fourierCoeffPos_fullReflect (B_w = A_{w*}(σ)). KEY FINDING: σ twist requires L² expansion REGARDLESS of reindexing. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs). See §8.11.25.\",\"id\":\"71\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 18): PROVED triple_product_character_matrix_integral (Step 1 of Lemma 5). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2972 jobs).\",\"id\":\"72\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 19): PROVED gram_matrix_psd_nonneg (Step 2 of Lemma 5). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2972 jobs).\",\"id\":\"73\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 20): PROVED multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg (Step 3 of Lemma 5). 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2857 jobs).\",\"id\":\"74\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 21): PROVED reflection_positivity_reorganization (Step 4b of Lemma 5) + integral_matrix_element_trivial_projection. 0 sorries, 0 NEW custom axioms. Build GREEN (2857 jobs).\",\"id\":\"75\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-04 session 22): PROVED character_times_matrix_element_integral + triple_product_character_matrix_integral_timelike. Time-like triple product WITHOUT conjugation. 0 sorries, 0 NEW custom axioms. Build GREEN (2857 jobs). See §8.11.27.\",\"id\":\"77\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-05 session 23): ANALYZED character-level approach (§8.11.28) — does NOT directly work. KEY FINDINGS: (1) fullReflectReindex w* gives kernel |Φ_w⟩⟨Φ_{w*}| (NOT rank-1 same-vector), (2) σ twist breaks Mercer-PD structure (delta function δ(V⁰,σ(U⁰)) is discontinuous), (3) PD property of exp(-β·S_int) doesn't help because h factors break the quadratic form. CONCLUSION: L² expansion is NECESSARY. Documented in §8.11.29. Build unchanged (GREEN, 2857 jobs).\",\"id\":\"76\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-05 session 24): PROVED transfer_matrix_fubini_integrated_pull_fullReflect (Step 1 of Lemma 5 Step 4a). Combines Step 4e + Lemma 3 to give fullReflect form: Complex.ofReal(∫ψ·Tψ) = C·∑_w F(w)·∫ Ψ_w·A_w·A_{w*}(σ) dμ⁰. 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. Build GREEN (2891 jobs). Also did DEEP ANALYSIS of reorganization challenge (§8.11.30).\",\"id\":\"78\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-05 session 25): DEEP ANALYSIS of reorganization (§8.11.31). KEY FINDINGS: (1) Reorganization CANNOT be done term-by-term — requires sum over w. (2) PD property of K alone does NOT imply ∫f(g)·f(g⁻¹)·K(g)≥0. (3) For single time-like link, per-λ integral is NOT ≥0 (inner product ⟨R,Q⟩, not norm squared). (4) Sum over σ gives Gram matrix (PSD), but