{"id":24,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 2697 lines, 157635 bytes --\n2460 |    `plaquetteBoltzmannPD`.\n2461 | 2. Positive-definiteness of the plaquette factor implies that the transfer\n2462 |    matrix `T` (which integrates out the negative-time links with the\n2463 |    reflection kernel) is a positive operator on `L²(SU(N)^{spatial})`.\n2464 |    The temporal interface links are integrated out as part of the transfer\n2465 |    matrix kernel (Lüscher decomposition `T = V^{1/2}·U·V^{1/2}`), avoiding\n2466 |    the `σ` twist.\n2467 | 3. The identity `∫ G(U)·G(θU) dμ₀ = ∫ g(u)·(Tg)(u) dμ⁺⁰` (proved in\n2468 |    `TransferMatrix.lean` as `integral_G_thetaG_eq_inner_g_Tg`) then gives\n2469 |    `∫ G·G(θU) ≥ 0` from the positivity of `T`.\n2470 | \n2471 | Steps 2–3 require the full transfer-matrix construction (measure-theoretic\n2472 | factorization of the product Haar measure, Fubini, and the character-expansion\n2473 | argument).  The positive-definiteness of the plaquette factor (step 1) is the\n2474 | key input and is proved in `PeterWeyl.lean`; the remaining measure theory is\n2475 | axiomatized here.  See `docs/found_issues.md` §3 and `docs/gap_analysis.md`. -/\n2476 | axiom transferMatrixPositivity_axiom (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n2477 |     (hT : Odd T) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n2478 |     (hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosSpatialInterface N T L f) :\n2479 |     0 ≤ ∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L)\n2480 |         (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2481 |       osG N T L β f\n2482 |         (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L)\n2483 |           (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) cfg) *\n2484 |       osG N T L β f\n2485 |         (reflectLinkVariable N\n2486 |           (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L)\n2487 |             (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) cfg))\n2488 |       ∂ productHaarMeasure N (PeriodicSite T L)\n2489 |         (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n2490 | \n2491 | lemma gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n2492 |     (hT : Odd T) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ)\n2493 |     (hf_supported : dependsOnlyOnPosSpatialInterface N T L f) :\n2494 |     0 ≤ gibbsExpectation N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n2495 |       (λ U => f U * reflectObservable N f U) := by\n2496 |   dsimp [gibbsExpectation]\n2497 |   have hZ_pos : partitionFunctionFinite N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) > 0 :=\n2498 |     partitionFunctionFinite_pos N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))\n2499 |   refine div_nonneg ?_ (le_of_lt hZ_pos)\n2500 |   set μ₀ := productHaarMeasure N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hμ₀\n2501 |   set S_total := wilsonActionFiniteConfig N β (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hS\n2502 |   set U_ext := extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) with hU\n2503 |   have h_total_decomp : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2504 |       S_total cfg = wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n2505 |         wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n2506 |         wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) := by\n2507 |     intro cfg\n2508 |     calc\n2509 |       S_total cfg = wilsonActionFinite N β (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) (U_ext cfg) := rfl\n2510 |       _ = wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n2511 |           wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n2512 |           wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) :=\n2513 |         total_decomposition_os_periodic N T L β (U_ext cfg)\n2514 |   have h_neg_reflect : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2515 |       wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) =\n2516 |       wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) := by\n2517 |     intro cfg\n2518 |     exact neg_action_reflection_os_periodic N T L β hT (U_ext cfg)\n2519 |   have h_int_reflect : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2520 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) =\n2521 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) := by\n2522 |     intro cfg\n2523 |     exact interface_action_reflection_symmetric_os_periodic N T L β hT (U_ext cfg)\n2524 |   have h_factorization : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2525 |       Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) = \n2526 |       (Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg)) *\n2527 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2)) *\n2528 |       (Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg))) *\n2529 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) / 2)) := by\n2530 |     intro cfg\n2531 |     rw [h_total_decomp cfg]\n2532 |     have h_mul : -β * (wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg) + wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg) +\n2533 |       wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) = \n2534 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSPositive N T L β (U_ext cfg)) + \n2535 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSNegative N T L β (U_ext cfg)) + \n2536 |       (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) := by ring\n2537 |     rw [h_mul]\n2538 |     rw [Real.exp_add, Real.exp_add]\n2539 |     rw [h_neg_reflect cfg, h_int_reflect cfg]\n2540 |     have h_exp_split : Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) =\n2541 |       Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) *\n2542 |       Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) := by\n2543 |       calc\n2544 |         Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg)) =\n2545 |           Real.exp ((-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) +\n2546 |                    (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2)) := by ring\n2547 |         _ = Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) *\n2548 |             Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β (U_ext cfg) / 2) := by rw [Real.exp_add]\n2549 |     rw [h_exp_split]\n2550 |     ring\n2551 |   set G := osG N T L β f with hG\n2552 |   have h_integrand_eq : ∀ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2553 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) *\n2554 |       Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) =\n2555 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) := by\n2556 |     intro cfg\n2557 |     dsimp [G, osG]\n2558 |     rw [h_factorization cfg]\n2559 |     ring\n2560 |   have h_fun_eq : (λ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))) =>\n2561 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) * Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg)) =\n2562 |     (λ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))) =>\n2563 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg))) := by\n2564 |     ext cfg; exact h_integrand_eq cfg\n2565 |   calc\n2566 |     (∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2567 |       f (U_ext cfg) * f (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) * Real.exp (-β * S_total cfg) ∂ μ₀)\n2568 |         = (∫ (cfg : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L))),\n2569 |       G (U_ext cfg) * G (reflectLinkVariable N (U_ext cfg)) ∂ μ₀) := by\n2570 |       rw [h_fun_eq]\n2571 |     _ ≥ 0 := by\n2572 |       -- GOAL: Prove that ∫ G(U)·G(θU) dμ₀(U) ≥ 0.\n2573 |       -- The positivity follows from `transferMatrixPositivity_axiom`, which is\n2574 |       -- justified by `plaquetteBoltzmannPD` (Peter-Weyl / Clebsch-Gordan) ⟹\n2575 |       -- transfer matrix T positive ⟹ ∫ G·G(θU) ≥ 0.  See the axiom's docstring.\n2576 |       exact transferMatrixPositivity_axiom N T L β hT f hf_supported\n2577 | \n2578 | /-! ## Clean factorization and the PD-structure obstruction\n2579 | \n2580 | The reflection-positivity integrand `osG(U) · osG(θU)` factorizes cleanly as\n2581 | `f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U))` (lemma `osG_thetaG_factorization` below).\n2582 | This shows that the axiom `transferMatrixPositivity_axiom` is equivalent to:\n2583 | \n2584 |     ∫ f(U) · f(θU) · exp(-β S_W(U)) dμ₀ ≥ 0\n2585 | \n2586 | where `exp(-β S_W)` is the full Boltzmann factor, proved positive-definite on the\n2587 | full link-variable group by `boltzmannFactorPD` (in `BoltzmannFactor.lean`).\n2588 | \n2589 | **Key obstruction**: this integral is NOT the standard positive-definite quadratic\n\n... 108 more line(s) below (use offset=2590 to continue reading)\nTime: 2026-08-06 04:07:49 UTC","timestamp":1785989269,"token_count":2770,"tool_call_id":"f87ae66f-3736-4cef-9510-08e2f9f2430e","full_token_estimate":1825,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":2697,"byte_count":157635,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":1,"edit_line":null},"turn":11,"is_prune_marker":false}
